    {
      "id": "claim_8302f5ea73a64992b5528494d9b360fd",
      "statement": "The lower test layers are structurally prevented from reaching a paid model: the unit and end-to-end scripts export the replay backend with the paid switch off, and the CI workflow sets the same values at job level so a future job that forgets the script still cannot reach a live model.",
