    {
      "id": "claim_250cf7380ba94e8b80eb8c7208a148f0",
      "statement": "The conformance suite validates itself before validating the codebase — asserting it found files, that each subdirectory scan has something to scan, that markdown and its own source are excluded, and that a deliberately injected violation is caught and its removal clears the suite.",
